  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {修練|しゅうれん}を{積|つ}む (to accumulate training)\n- {修練|しゅうれん}を{重|かさ}ねる (to train repeatedly)\n- {修練|しゅうれん}{期間|きかん} (training period)\n{修練|しゅうれん} emphasizes disciplined, often spiritual or character-building practice. More formal and traditional than {練習|れんしゅう}.\n- Martial arts\n- Religious/spiritual practice\n- Traditional arts (tea ceremony, calligraphy)\n- Professional development\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {鍛錬|たんれん} (tempering, training - physical emphasis)\n- {練習|れんしゅう} (practice - general)\n- {修行|しゅぎょう} (ascetic training)\n- {訓練|くんれん} (drill, training)",
